  m_text: 'Context: Both players are mono pole magnets trying to form a Dipoler magnet
    by combining with each other. Both players are separeted with different kinds
    of surfaces (with or without magnetism). Color of the surfaces indicated it''s
    magnetic polarity. Goal of the level is to reach to back box door.


    Special
    Case: Black surfaces are like black hole but opposite. They repuls both poles.
    (Applicable to palyers not other static surfaces)'
